  "reason": "Evidence: RNA-only with scgpt+transformer (config_001, acc=0.514) outperforms both multimodal+resnet50 experiments (config_010 concat=0.471, config_038 weighted=0.494), suggesting ResNet50 image features are not complementing scgpt RNA features under transformer aggregation. Uncertainty: We don't yet know whether the image modality can add value with a different encoder, or whether the bottleneck is specifically ResNet50's feature representation. This experiment tests scgpt + imagenet_vit_l with transformer aggregation and concat fusion, isolating the image encoder as the variable while keeping the best-performing RNA encoder and aggregation. If ViT also underperforms RNA-only, we gain strong evidence to pivot fully toward RNA-only optimization with the remaining 6 experiments. If it succeeds, it identifies a promising multimodal direction to exploit. This is the highest-information experiment for the central question of whether multimodal fusion can beat the current best."
}

